No kindlasti mitte,

125
00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:13.160
sellepärast et Louvre 'is oleks
kohalik korra,

126
00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.680
kohalikud korravalvurid oleks mind
juba ammu sealt arreteerinud

127
00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.980
